%[text] - MATLAB build tool introduction blog post:  [https://blogs.mathworks.com/developer/2022/10/17/building-blocks-with-buildtool](https://blogs.mathworks.com/developer/2022/10/17/building-blocks-with-buildtool/)
%[text] - Faster testing with MATLAB build tool blog post:  [https://blogs.mathworks.com/developer/2025/07/02/test-impact-analysis-intro](https://blogs.mathworks.com/developer/2025/07/02/test-impact-analysis-intro)
%[text] - Developer Zone blog:  [https://blogs.mathworks.com/developer](https://blogs.mathworks.com/developer/)
%[text] - CI licensing for private repositories:  [https://www.mathworks.com/support/batch-tokens.html](https://www.mathworks.com/support/batch-tokens.html) \
